<title>HONG KONG: IBM names greater China executive for PCs.</title>
<headline>IBM names greater China executive for PCs.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Business Machines Corp (IBM) said on Wednesday it has appointed Richmond Lo as general manager for IBM PC Company, IBM Greater China Group.</p>
<p>Based in Hong Kong, Lo will oversee IBM's personal computer (PC) business in China, Hong Kong and Taiwan, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
